yd_yor_054	Yoruba · Nigeria	Ojú tó bá jẹun tó tó ni yóò sùn — Eyes that have eaten ____ will sleep	enough	["enough", "late", "early", "well"]	0	Ojú tó bá jẹun tó tó ni yóò sùn	beginner	Satisfaction brings rest. When a person's genuine needs are met they naturally find peace.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_yor_055	Yoruba · Nigeria	Ènìyàn ni ìṣura — ____ is the greatest treasure	People	["People", "Gold", "Land", "Time"]	0	Ènìyàn ni ìṣura	beginner	Human relationships and community are the most valuable assets anyone can possess. Material wealth pales beside genuine human connection.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_yor_056	Yoruba · Nigeria	Inú rere ni ìgbàlà — A good ____ is salvation	heart	["heart", "name", "home", "word"]	0	Inú rere ni ìgbàlà	intermediate	Inner goodness — kindness, generosity, compassion — is what ultimately saves and sustains a person through life's difficulties.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_yor_057	Yoruba · Nigeria	Ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ọwọ́ ni í gbé ẹrù — Many ____ carry the load	hands	["hands", "minds", "hearts", "voices"]	0	Ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ọwọ́ ni í gbé ẹrù	beginner	Collective effort makes even the heaviest burdens manageable. This is the foundation of communal African society.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_yor_058	Yoruba · Nigeria	Bí omi bá pọ̀, ẹja ò nírẹlẹ̀ — When water is ____, the fish feels no fear	abundant	["abundant", "cold", "warm", "still"]	0	Bí omi bá pọ̀, ẹja ò nírẹlẹ̀	intermediate	A person thrives when their environment is supportive and resources are plentiful. Security enables courage.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_yor_059	Yoruba · Nigeria	Ọ̀kọ̀ tó bá gun igi kì í rẹ̀rẹ̀ — An axe that climbs a ____ does not get weary	tree	["tree", "hill", "wall", "rock"]	0	Ọ̀kọ̀ tó bá gun igi kì í rẹ̀rẹ̀	intermediate	A tool used correctly never fails at its purpose. When you work in alignment with your nature you do not tire easily.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_yor_060	Yoruba · Nigeria	Aṣiwèrè ni í sọ ohun tí ó wà nínú àpò rẹ̀ — Only a ____ reveals what is in their bag	fool	["fool", "thief", "child", "elder"]	0	Aṣiwèrè ni í sọ ohun tí ó wà nínú àpò rẹ̀	intermediate	Wisdom requires discretion. Revealing all your resources, plans and intentions unnecessarily exposes you to exploitation.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
