yd_yor_062	Yoruba · Nigeria	Ìṣọra kò pani — ____ does not kill	Caution	["Caution", "Silence", "Patience", "Wisdom"]	0	Ìṣọra kò pani	intermediate	Being careful and deliberate in your actions costs nothing but can save everything. Caution is never a weakness.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_yor_063	Yoruba · Nigeria	Ẹni bá f'owó bọ ẹlẹgàn ni yóò fi ọwọ́ jẹun pẹlú wọn — One who befriends the ____ will eat with them	scorned	["scorned", "mighty", "wise", "wealthy"]	0	Ẹni bá f'owó bọ ẹlẹgàn ni yóò fi ọwọ́ jẹun pẹlú wọn	advanced	Do not look down on those society dismisses. Today's outcast may be tomorrow's provider. Treat all people with dignity.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_yor_064	Yoruba · Nigeria	Ara ẹni ni ó sọ ohun tí ó jẹ — One's own ____ tells what it has eaten	body	["body", "mouth", "shadow", "spirit"]	0	Ara ẹni ni ó sọ ohun tí ó jẹ	advanced	Your physical and spiritual condition reflects your true lifestyle. You cannot hide what you truly are for long.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
