yd_ibo_058	Igbo · Nigeria	Ihe dị mma na-adịghị ____ — Good things do not last ____	forever	["forever", "alone", "still", "cheap"]	0	Ihe dị mma na-adịghị adị	intermediate	Nothing beautiful is permanent. Appreciate what is good while you have it rather than assuming it will always be there.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_ibo_059	Igbo · Nigeria	Aka nri kwọọ aka ekpe, aka ekpe kwọọ aka nri — The right hand washes the left, the left washes the ____	right	["right", "face", "ground", "air"]	0	Aka nri kwọọ aka ekpe, aka ekpe kwọọ aka nri	beginner	Mutual support and reciprocity keep both parties clean and functional. No one succeeds entirely without the help of others.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
yd_ibo_060	Igbo · Nigeria	Onye na-eme ihe ọ chefuo oge ya na-eme ya, ọ gaghị eme ihe ọ ____ — He who forgets when he is doing something will not finish it	planned	["planned", "started", "wished", "forgot"]	0	Onye na-eme ihe ọ chefuo oge	advanced	Focus and intentionality are essential to completion. Losing sight of your purpose midway through a task guarantees failure.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
