yd_ibo_062	Igbo · Nigeria	Agụụ agụọ ogaranya, ọ naghị eji ya agụọ ____ — Hunger humbles the rich man but not his ____	name	["name", "family", "land", "debt"]	0	Agụụ agụọ ogaranya	advanced	Hardship can reduce even the wealthy but some things — reputation, lineage — persist beyond material loss. Guard what cannot be taken.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
