yd_hau_058	Hausa · Nigeria	Masoya suna jin ____ — Friends feel each other's ____	pain	["pain", "joy", "dreams", "silence"]	0	Masoya suna jin ciwon juna	beginner	True friendship means sharing not just in celebration but in suffering. A friend who only appears in good times is not a friend.	2026-05-24 00:17:27.803645+00
